Table: Protect
[@mannerOfProtection] [@targetToProtect]

Table: targetToProtect
roll: 3d6
3-8: A valuable object
9-10: A person
11-12: A group of People
13-18: A place

Table: mannerOfProtection
roll:3d6
3-7:guide
8: gaurd
9-10: escort
11-12: defend
13: guide and gaurd
14: guide and escort
15: guard and escort
16-18: guide, escort, and guard